Template: homelab-api/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Where homelab-database's shared `homelab` database lives. Used only
 once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role (local
 sudo -u postgres, or the same over SSH, or a manual fallback — never a
 stored credential). Ignored on upgrade if already configured.

Template: homelab-api/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:
 Where homelab-pgbouncer runs. Used only once, at first install, to run
 homelab-bootstrap-pgbouncer-entry. Ignored on upgrade if already
 configured. This is also the value written into config.yml's
 database.host, so the running service connects through the pooler.
